# Ledger 228 (found reproducing Nov 16 20:42:18): a thin jungle tree under a wide crown, cut in its second log, went
# over crown first and stood upside down on its top log, turning on that one point and never coming to rest.
# questcheck --scene quest/scenes/tree-lies-down.scene --seed 3084501862406496736 --headset
# After: it lies across its stump, its top on the ground, still within 3 s (tilt 0.79, spin 0).
